  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "TSpec now mocks with its own engine instead of Moq\n\t\t\t* Replace using static Moq.Times with using static TSpec.Times\n\t\t\t* On the .NET 10 SDK, dotnet test needs \"test\": { \"runner\": \"Microsoft.Testing.Platform\" } in global.json, and MTP extensions such as TrxReport need 2.x\n\t\t\t* A mock set up only with Given<T>().Returns or Throws is now given to a constructor parameter that has a default\n\t\t\t* Then(value) throws SetupFailed for a value type handed over before the pipeline runs",
